[Global]
IconName=org.kde.kwi
DesktopEntry=org.kde.kwi
Name=Kwi
Comment=Terminal notifications
Comment[de]=Terminalbenachrichtigungen
Comment[ko]=터미널 알림

[Event/bell]
Name=Terminal bell
Name[de]=Terminal-Signalton
Name[ko]=터미널 벨
Comment=A terminal that is not currently focused requests attention
Comment[de]=Ein Terminal ohne Eingabefokus erfordert Aufmerksamkeit
Comment[ko]=현재 초점이 없는 터미널에서 주의를 요청함
Sound=bell-window-system
Action=Popup

[Event/notification]
Name=Program notification
Name[de]=Programmbenachrichtigung
Name[ko]=프로그램 알림
Comment=A program in a terminal that is not currently focused requests a notification
Comment[de]=Ein Programm in einem Terminal ohne Eingabefokus fordert eine Benachrichtigung an
Comment[ko]=현재 초점이 없는 터미널의 프로그램에서 알림을 요청함
Action=Popup

[Event/activity]
Name=Activity in a monitored terminal
Name[de]=Aktivität in einem überwachten Terminal
Name[ko]=지켜보는 터미널에서 활동 발생
Comment=New output arrived in a terminal with activity monitoring enabled
Comment[de]=Neue Ausgabe in einem Terminal, dessen Aktivität überwacht wird
Comment[ko]=활동 상태를 지켜보는 터미널에 새 출력이 있음
Action=Popup

[Event/silence]
Name=Silence in a monitored terminal
Name[de]=Inaktivität in einem überwachten Terminal
Name[ko]=지켜보는 터미널에서 응답 없음
Comment=Output stopped for the configured interval in a monitored terminal
Comment[de]=Keine Ausgabe während des eingestellten Intervalls in einem überwachten Terminal
Comment[ko]=지켜보는 터미널에서 설정한 시간 동안 출력이 없음
Action=Popup
